  "content": {
    "component": "news_article",
    "_uid": "3265-root",
    "title": "Applications are now open!",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "Applications for the MA in Muslim Cultures are now open, inviting passionate individuals to embark on a transformative educational journey.",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "0e78466ea2735569",
        "component": "news_media",
        "role": "banner",
        "filename": "3265-BannerImage.jpg",
        "src": "/news-media/3265-BannerImage.jpg",
        "media_type": "image",
        "caption": null,
        "alt": "Applications are now open!"
      }
    ],
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "In a globalised world where understanding and appreciating diverse cultures is more critical than ever, Aga Khan University's Institute for the Study of Muslim Cultures (AKU-ISMC) proudly announces the opening of applications for its Master's in Muslim Cultures program."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The MA in Muslim Cultures at AKU-ISMC is not just a degree; it's an immersive journey into the rich tapestry of Muslim civilisations. Designed with an interdisciplinary approach, the program offers students the unique opportunity to delve into the complexities and nuances of Muslim cultures across the globe."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "At the heart of this program is a distinguished faculty renowned for their expertise in various disciplines. This interdisciplinary approach prepares graduates to navigate the multifaceted challenges of our interconnected world."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "AKU-ISMC's MA programme goes beyond the classroom, providing students with a global perspective through international collaborations and research opportunities. The institute's commitment to academic excellence is reflected in its state-of-the-art research facilities and partnerships with leading institutions worldwide."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Applications for the MA in Muslim Cultures are now open, inviting passionate individuals to embark on a transformative educational journey. Whether you're a recent graduate or a professional seeking to deepen your understanding of Muslim cultures, this program offers a platform to cultivate critical thinking, cultural sensitivity, and global awareness. For more information about the application procedure, please click "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "here",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "link",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "https://www.aku.edu/ismc/ma/Pages/apply.aspx",
                    "target": "_blank",
                    "linktype": "url",
                    "uuid": null,
                    "anchor": null,
                    "custom": {}
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "."
            },
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Visit AKU-ISMC's "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "application portal",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                },
                {
                  "type": "link",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "https://akuross.aku.edu/psc/csonadm/EMPLOYEE/SA/c/AKU_OA_MENU.AKU_OA_LOGIN_CMP.GBL?&",
                    "target": "_blank",
                    "linktype": "url",
                    "uuid": null,
                    "anchor": null,
                    "custom": {}
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " to start your journey today."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Don't miss the chance to be part of a community dedicated to fostering dialogue, understanding, and appreciation of Muslim cultures."
            },
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            }
          ]
